Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell

Usage: headscale completion [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  bash        Generate the autocompletion script for bash
  fish        Generate the autocompletion script for fish
  powershell  Generate the autocompletion script for powershell
  zsh         Generate the autocompletion script for zsh
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -c, --config <CONFIG>  config file (default is /etc/headscale/config.yaml) [env: HEADSCALE_CONFIG=]
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Output format. Empty for human-readable, 'json', 'json-line' or 'yaml'
      --force            Disable prompts and forces the execution
  -h, --help             Print help
